  "label": "The group of professionals is mapped as 'people who were just doing their jobs'",
  "description": "The text 'it happened because of people who were just doing their jobs' is directly analogically mapped onto the visual entity 'person' (the diverse group of six professionals). The visual depiction of the group posing confidently in business attire, with smiles and professional postures, serves as the visual representation of the textual claim that they were merely performing their duties. This mapping is central to the meme's intent to deflect accountability by attributing collective responsibility to the group rather than a single individual.",
